// ai.provider.list and probe, the ai.model methods, ai.bench.run and
// ai.prompt.verify, a language model called as a step of a run. The Doc
// literals are copies of internal/catalog/ai's docs, kept equal by
// internal/archtest's TestCatalogDataDocsMatchTheRegistry.
